a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And why would the Red Talons be considered \u201cproblematic\u201d? In the fact that their hard to make a PC because they hate humans?</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine because it's hard to sell the game as not edgelord when the other tribes consider the guys supporting genocide to be &quot;just kind of jerks.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-23-2021, 08:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T06:34:31-07:00","id":1461009,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461003#post1461003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Making one of the tribes of Indigenous Garou antagonists would be even more problematic. And why would the Red Talons be considered \u201cproblematic\u201d? In the fact that their hard to make a PC because they hate humans?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Well, the least genocidal of their tribe's factions wants to &quot;merely&quot; kill around 90% of humans on earth. They are antagonist material, especially in V5 where the sabbat book is written as ST npcs only.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24043,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","user":"Nyremne","date":". 09-23-2021, 09:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T06:37:36-07:00","id":1461011,"title":"","content":"Well this is certainly terrible news. Everything I disliked about the metaplot in BNS's LARP rules is front and center here. Looks like I won't be buying any W5 products and just sticking to W20.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T06:46:15-07:00","id":1461013,"title":"","content":"Here's the whole text from the issue<br /> <br /> &quot;The Garou<br /> <br /> Champions of a mother-spirit charged with defending her against the demiurges of chaos, order and entropy, all seeking her destruction, the Garou are creatures of Rage and Spirit, of Wolk and Man. Warlike shapeshifters, the werewolves possess a tremendous culture and legacy, but they are at odds with one another over how best to defend their mother.<br /> <br /> The only ways they know have failed them.<br /> <br /> Gaia, the world-spirit who may have created the Garou and gave them their purpose, is dying. The Apocalypse has come and gone and we live in it's aftermath, the Garous among us, dying out like their mother. That is ,the world itself is dying - These are the times of the Malady, of the world's warming and the water rising, as mankind steal away the very substance of Gaia herself to fashion it into trinkets and builds shrines to their own greed.<br /> <br /> A symptom of the Malady; Gaia's Howl, reverberated among the wilds and the spirit-places and even in the cities of humans as the Malady fouled the Earth. It has been perceptible by the Garou ever since, and werewolves can see, hear, taste, smell and even feel it's waning pulse. Gaia's Howl is inescapable, which the Garou liken to moans of pain as Gaia continues to die.<br /> <br /> And what of the tribes?<br /> <br /> The great tribes of the Garou have existed since before human history, and today their celebrated heroes recount tales of their own significance, insisting that the Apocalypse is yet to come and will be a glorious battle, or that the Garou have already won it! Others lament the inexorable despoilment of Gaia, succu\u00f9bing to hopelessness, driven to despair by her hown.<br /> <br /> Until recently, a fragile unity bonded the tribes, but that unity has broken. The Garou Nation is shattered, and the very litany it once upheld is itself in question. What use are pacts and promises when the Mother they existed to protect breathes her last?<br /> <br /> One of the tribes has abandoned the others entirely, so convinced are they of the truth of their cause and the inaction of other werewolves. Another tribe has lost faith in the Garou and has withdrawn to seek other allies in the fight against Gaia's foes. Now, the only group a werewolf can trust is their own pack.<br /> <br /> Yet still the Garou fight on, in honor of their mother, to take back what has been lost, and to call upon the fires of their Rage to light a beacon, a bonfire, a conflagration agaisnt the darkness.<br /> <br /> Will you heed their cry?<br /> <br /> What legends will the Garou sing of you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T06:56:28-07:00","id":1461015,"title":"","content":"A few comment from analysing the text and using the plot points of Heart of the Forest:<br /> <br /> &quot;defending her agaisnt the demiurges of chaos, order and entropy&quot;<br /> <br /> The way this is formulated, plus the whole &quot;the apocalypse happened and went away&quot; may imply that the garou inflicted a heavy defeat to the wyrm, so much that it is now &quot;merely&quot; one of the threat to gaia, and that the garou now consider the wild as a potential threat to gaia.<br /> To that, my theory is that said defeat to the wyrm weakened in a way the weaver's web on the wyld, and the wyld being chaos, it now threaten more than it helps.<br /> <br /> <br /> As for the garou nation and the two tribes, first, the litany being questionned happens in a way in Heart of the forest, with the main character, during her initiation, only pledging four of all the tenets of the litany, which imply that each sept has it's interpretation.<br /> <br /> For the tribe that is &quot;going too far&quot;. Two options, the red talons, for reasons obvious, or the Get of fenrir. Those are also extreme in their belief of ragnarok and they are described in HotF as being sort of separated from the rest.<br /> <br /> For the tribe that went away to find new allies, my bet is either on the Children of Gaia or the Glass Walkers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T08:24:47-07:00","id":1461029,"title":"","content":"&quot;The BSDs are wrong about Gaia... except they're not! She's dead! Enjoy your heaping plate of Angst, you non-Vampire players!&quot;<br /> <br /> (beat)<br /> <br /> &quot;Wait, where are you going? I was going to completely distort the concept of several different tribes!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T08:33:27-07:00","id":1461031,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461029#post1461029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;The BSDs are wrong about Gaia... except they're not! She's dead! Enjoy your heaping plate of Angst, you non-Vampire players!&quot;<br /> <br /> (beat)<br /> <br /> &quot;Wait, where are you going? I was going to completely distort the concept of several different tribes!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yep. I read this as &quot;let's give the core setting and the grain of hope that existed in it a kick in the pants and a swirly!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T09:17:40-07:00","id":1461037,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461015#post1461015\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A few comment from analysing the text and using the plot points of Heart of the Forest:<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;defending her agaisnt the demiurges of chaos, order and entropy&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> The way this is formulated, plus the whole &amp;quot;the apocalypse happened and went away&amp;quot; may imply that the garou inflicted a heavy defeat to the wyrm, so much that it is now &amp;quot;merely&amp;quot; one of the threat to gaia, and that the garou now consider the wild as a potential threat to gaia.<br /> To that, my theory is that said defeat to the wyrm weakened in a way the weaver's web on the wyld, and the wyld being chaos, it now threaten more than it helps.<br /> <br /> <br /> As for the garou nation and the two tribes, first, the litany being questionned happens in a way in Heart of the forest, with the main character, during her initiation, only pledging four of all the tenets of the litany, which imply that each sept has it's interpretation.<br /> <br /> For the tribe that is &amp;quot;going too far&amp;quot;. Two options, the red talons, for reasons obvious, or the Get of fenrir. Those are also extreme in their belief of ragnarok and they are described in HotF as being sort of separated from the rest.<br /> <br /> For the tribe that went away to find new allies, my bet is either on the Children of Gaia or the Glass Walkers</div> </div> </div> </div>Could be the the Fianna with the fae do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T09:28:48-07:00","id":1461038,"title":"","content":"I mean I still say Stagazer but that's in the sense of, &quot;The Banu Haqim are joining the Camarilla!&quot; Which is to say its following up on a plot that was already there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T09:52:32-07:00","id":1461043,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461029#post1461029\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;The BSDs are wrong about Gaia... except they're not! She's dead! Enjoy your heaping plate of Angst, you <b>non-Vampire players</b>!&quot;<br /> <br /> (beat)<br /> <br /> &quot;Wait, where are you going? I was going to completely distort the concept of several different tribes!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly this, there is this want for the tiny hope in the game to be squished. Often by people more familiar with Vampire. I'm not saying it's everyone, but it is a common theme.<br /> <br /> The mentality of 'Going fighting to the good night' is ignored in both this and the BNS. The Apocalypse, the end of all ends, happens and it is... not an apocalypse? This might be just me, but you cannot just go 'oh the apocalypse just happened', because then there would be either no life left, or a very different world from our own. Because the Apocalypse won't stay in the umbra or in hidden places, once that sucker starts there is no Veil anymore.<br /> <br /> Yet the BNS game still takes place in a world very similar to our own, with humanity apparently no worse for wear.<br /> <br /> It cheapens the title of the game, if the apocalypse was not even world-shaking enough event for humanity to notice.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T10:23:48-07:00","id":1461047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461001#post1461001\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, a couple of US states killed 90% of their wolf populations within 2 weeks very recently so its very dependant on location.</div> </div> </div> </div>As much as wild life protection isn't a unanimous topic, and never will, it doesn't mean the situation isn't extremely different from 30 years ago. In the 90's the very notion of wolf protection was controversial and only actively defended by a few. Today what's happening in those US states is considered outrageous. Preservation shifted from a niche to a mainstream worry all around the world. We faced many losses already, but we also achieved some victories and saved several species on the brink of extinction.<br /> <br /> We aren't in a good position. But things changed a lot, and the setting wasn't designed to account for this. We also learned a lot about nature that we didn't knew when the setting was developed, like how wolf packs actually work (just a hint: Red Talon culture has a lot of bull shit about what wolves are like).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461003#post1461003\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And why would the Red Talons be considered \u201cproblematic\u201d? In the fact that their hard to make a PC because they hate humans?</div> </div> </div> </div>In the fact that they hate humans the way they do. They are the very example of indiscriminate hate and bigotry. And they're a caricature of minority groups and foreign cultures, wielding that hate (not rage, but actual hate) while keeping themselves &quot;primitive&quot; to not be &quot;tainted&quot;.<br /> <br /> Finally, saying this is explained by them being wolves is bull shit since A) wolves aren't a cultural minority that you can point and say how they behave or what they want or defend, B) the setting pretty much had no idea on how wolves behave in nature, so Red Talon culture isn't wolf culture, it is Red Talon culture, and C) Luddism is a pretty human idea.<br /> <br /> The Red Talons are just a sick inference that a whole culture can be geared towards hate and endorsement of terrorism, and actually solely defined by it, and that for the wronged genocide is an ok idea. They're not a persecuted group, they're a joke on persecuted groups.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461043#post1461043\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It cheapens the title of the game, if the apocalypse was not even world-shaking enough event for humanity to notice.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the same problem they had with Gehenna. Instead of going for it all out or postponing it, they decided it came and was kind of not a big deal in the big picture. So move to the next step in the metaplot, but don't change the <i>status quo</i> too much. That's my whole expectation for W5.<br /> <br /> Both going all out or backing down and postponing the Apocalypse would be better decisions, with a healthy update of the setting, but not forgetting that it is Werewolf, not Angstwolf.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T10:29:36-07:00","id":1461048,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1460990#post1460990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One of the few things i like about the BNS meta, is that Younger Brother has something truly interesting to deal with. Gaia's death sent a spiritual wave that &amp;quot;activated&amp;quot; lots of long lost kin families. This includes Younger Brother's kin in Eurasia that they left behind when moving to North America. So, unlike the unpleasantness of Evan, there are suddenly Sami kin giving birth to Garou that are spiritually drawn to the winter spirits. This creates a very interesting dynamic for the Tribe as they have something to focus on besides being angry at the European Tribes that still resonates with their core themes.<br /> <br /> It's also part of how the Silver Fangs keep Younger Brother in the Sanctum of Gaia (since a lot of those kin and new cubs are in Silver Fang territories), while Older Brother leaves to join the Shadow Lords in finding new answers to their new normal.<br /> <br /> It would also be a great reason to dump Younger Brother's old name.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually genetics shows that the population that migrated to the America\u2019s closest genetic relation is to Siberian\u2019s","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T10:36:13-07:00","id":1461054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461047#post1461047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's the same problem they had with Gehenna. Instead of going for it all out or postponing it, they decided it came and was kind of not a big deal in the big picture. So move to the next step in the metaplot, but don't change the <i>status quo</i> too much. That's my whole expectation for W5.<br /> <br /> Both going all out or backing down and postponing the Apocalypse would be better decisions, with a healthy update of the setting, but not forgetting that it is Werewolf, not Angstwolf.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is especially annoying, because if Gaia dies? There won't be anything left, its the final death, finito. If you want to forestall the apocalypse, give the garou a major victory. Give them a sense that MAYBE this isn't the end. In that way, you also keep up the Veil and humanity won't dramatically change.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T12:15:15-07:00","id":1461066,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461054#post1461054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It is especially annoying, because if Gaia dies? There won't be anything left, its the final death, finito. If you want to forestall the apocalypse, give the garou a major victory. Give them a sense that MAYBE this isn't the end. In that way, you also keep up the Veil and humanity won't dramatically change.</div> </div> </div> </div>I dunno, I kind of like the fact that the Apocalypse has been won.<br /> <br /> However, that doesn't help Gaia survive because it wasn't THE WYRM that was killing her. It was the Weaver.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T12:19:33-07:00","id":1461067,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461054#post1461054\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is especially annoying, because if Gaia dies? There won't be anything left, its the final death, finito. If you want to forestall the apocalypse, give the garou a major victory. Give them a sense that MAYBE this isn't the end. In that way, you also keep up the Veil and humanity won't dramatically change.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sincerely? I wanted a definitive victory. Something to really cheer about and them make space for new conflicts. Maybe even the current weather changes could be a result of the victory and the victorious Nation now split between those that want to help humans survive the cleansing and those who want to see humanity pay for its collective crimes. Or something else, really. Adapting to a world without the constant ultimate war, but a world still with a lot of things to do that can bring glory to Gaia's warriors, their Great Battle won and the next challenges waiting in the horizon.<br /> <br /> But not going to happen.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T12:20:46-07:00","id":1461068,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461067#post1461067\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Sincerely? I wanted a definitive victory. Something to really cheer about and them make space for new conflicts. Maybe even the current weather changes could be a result of the victory and the victorious Nation now split between those that want to help humans survive the cleansing and those who want to see humanity pay for its collective crimes. Or something else, really. Adapting to a world without the constant ultimate war, but a world still with a lot of things to do that can bring glory to Gaia's warriors, their Great Battle won and the next challenges waiting in the horizon.<br /> <br /> But not going to happen.</div> </div> </div> </div>Weirdly, I think that's exactly what's happened. The Apocalypse is over and &quot;won&quot; but that just means the Garou are left with the realization that winning the Spirit War did shit about saving the planet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T12:33:14-07:00","id":1461073,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461068#post1461068\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weirdly, I think that's exactly what's happened. The Apocalypse is over and &quot;won&quot; but that just means the Garou are left with the realization that winning the Spirit War did shit about saving the planet.</div> </div> </div> </div>It is the opposite, actually, because what I wanted was &quot;Glorious Victory&quot; and &quot;New Paths to Glory&quot;. Instead we got &quot;It Ends With a Whimper&quot; and &quot;New Paths to Angst&quot;.<br /> <br /> Angst is a Vampire theme. And I say that being more a fan of Vampire than Werewolf, but when I want angst I know where to go. Werewolf have a lot of darkness, but it is not the same kind of darkness. It is a darkness you can actually call on its Bullshit and face head-on, like the many extremists and the hypocrisy of many groups within the tribes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T13:37:42-07:00","id":1461079,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461073#post1461073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It is the opposite, actually, because what I wanted was &quot;Glorious Victory&quot; and &quot;New Paths to Glory&quot;. Instead we got &quot;It Ends With a Whimper&quot; and &quot;New Paths to Angst&quot;.<br /> <br /> Angst is a Vampire theme. And I say that being more a fan of Vampire than Werewolf, but when I want angst I know where to go. Werewolf have a lot of darkness, but it is not the same kind of darkness. It is a darkness you can actually call on its Bullshit and face head-on, like the many extremists and the hypocrisy of many groups within the tribes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Werewolves have always angsted, though!<br /> <br /> That was the whole point!<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, we're glorious Vikings and....yeah, we're going to lose this one.&quot;<br /> <br /> They even have a magical werewolf word for magical werewolf sadness. But I understand your perspective.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T14:00:56-07:00","id":1461082,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461079#post1461079\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Werewolves have always angsted, though!<br /> <br /> That was the whole point!<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, we're glorious Vikings and....yeah, we're going to lose this one.&quot;<br /> <br /> They even have a magical werewolf word for magical werewolf sadness. But I understand your perspective.</div> </div> </div> </div>Succumbing to harano is something the Garou are supposed to resist. They can't give up all hope or they fade into nothing and die. There seems to be no hope of saving Gaia or preventing the apocalypse in this setting so I don't see a reason why harano wouldn't be the default state of the remaining Garou.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T14:17:22-07:00","id":1461084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lunar Falcon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461082#post1461082\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There seems to be no hope of saving Gaia or preventing the apocalypse in this setting so I don't see a reason why harano wouldn't be the default state of the remaining Garou.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apparently it isn't because the default is delusion. Not &quot;I believe in fairies&quot; delusion, but &quot;the Earth is flat and anyone proving the opposite is a government conspirator&quot; delusion.<br /> <br /> Werewolves always had a special kind of angst linked to them, but it wasn't the focus of the game. The focus is to not feel angst even in the face of terrible odds. Falling to it is a key part of the theme as becoming a Wight is a key part of the theme in Vampire, and in both you're not supposed to ever reach this far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T14:23:46-07:00","id":1461085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461084#post1461084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Apparently it isn't because the default is delusion. Not &amp;quot;I believe in fairies&amp;quot; delusion, but &amp;quot;the Earth is flat and anyone proving the opposite is a government conspirator&amp;quot; delusion.<br /> <br /> Werewolves always had a special kind of angst linked to them, but it wasn't the focus of the game. The focus is to not feel angst even in the face of terrible odds. Falling to it is a key part of the theme as becoming a Wight is a key part of the theme in Vampire, and in both you're not supposed to ever reach this far.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly. If the only reason there are werewolves still fighting is because they are too stupid or deluded to know they lost then that seems like a really bad writing choice.<br /> <br /> NuWW is clearly telling me that they don't care about what came before and really don't need me or my money. At least I still have W20 and can pretend that this doesn't exist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T14:24:49-07:00","id":1461086,"title":"","content":"Eh, the fact the Werewolves have won is interesting to me. It's a case of &quot;Now what?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T14:31:41-07:00","id":1461088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461086#post1461086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, the fact the Werewolves have won is interesting to me. It's a case of &amp;quot;Now what?&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that the fact that Gaia is dead or currently dying clearly contradicts the idea that the garou won.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T15:23:53-07:00","id":1461096,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lunar Falcon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461088#post1461088\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that the fact that Gaia is dead or currently dying clearly contradicts the idea that the garou won.</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe a new Gaia will reincarnate. You never know with those spirit gods.<br /> <br /> Still, a lot is different if the Wyrm isn't looming over the head of everyojne, ready to invade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T15:34:09-07:00","id":1461099,"title":"","content":"The problem is that this isn't something like the Vienna Chantry getting smashed in terms of majorly shaking up the status of vampire politics.<br /> <br /> I understand that you like that Paradox is willing to make some major changes and all. But to WtA is more on the level of Lucifer publicly murdering Caine while proclaiming Christianity the one true religion of the WoD, killing every 8th Gen and lower vampire instantly, ,and turning the remaining vampires all into 15th gens or thinbloods. If you think the &quot;V5 isn't VtM because it changed too much,&quot; was bad... this is going to be so much worse.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T15:41:48-07:00","id":1461101,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461099#post1461099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is that this isn't something like the Vienna Chantry getting smashed in terms of majorly shaking up the status of vampire politics.<br /> <br /> I understand that you like that Paradox is willing to make some major changes and all. But to WtA is more on the level of Lucifer publicly murdering Caine while proclaiming Christianity the one true religion of the WoD, killing every 8th Gen and lower vampire instantly, ,and turning the remaining vampires all into 15th gens or thinbloods. If you think the &quot;V5 isn't VtM because it changed too much,&quot; was bad... this is going to be so much worse.</div> </div> </div> </div>You could well right.<br /> <br /> Like I said, I am less familiar with W:TA than I am with other gamlines. My first and only copy of the book series was the 2nd Edition Werewolf: The Apocalypse book with the claw marks on it and the comic with Evan/Albretch/Mari.<br /> <br /> I am interested in seeing where they go with this, I admit, but it could well be a trainwreck. Mind you, I'm hoping that the changes are less grandiose than other. Getting rid of all of the Caerns is a stupid thing in my view and I don't see why a second tribe would leave after the Stargazers. If one of the tribes DID fall like the Get, I'd hope they'd at least keep some to stay as members of the Garou nation.<br /> <br /> Because, well, I play Get whenever I do play (which is rarely).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T16:06:29-07:00","id":1461104,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461047#post1461047\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As much as wild life protection isn't a unanimous topic, and never will, it doesn't mean the situation isn't extremely different from 30 years ago. In the 90's the very notion of wolf protection was controversial and only actively defended by a few. Today what's happening in those US states is considered outrageous. Preservation shifted from a niche to a mainstream worry all around the world. We faced many losses already, but we also achieved some victories and saved several species on the brink of extinction.<br /> <br /> We aren't in a good position. But things changed a lot, and the setting wasn't designed to account for this. We also learned a lot about nature that we didn't knew when the setting was developed, like how wolf packs actually work (just a hint: Red Talon culture has a lot of bull shit about what wolves are like).<br /> <br /> <br /> In the fact that they hate humans the way they do. They are the very example of indiscriminate hate and bigotry. And they're a caricature of minority groups and foreign cultures, wielding that hate (not rage, but actual hate) while keeping themselves &quot;primitive&quot; to not be &quot;tainted&quot;.<br /> <br /> Finally, saying this is explained by them being wolves is bull shit since A) wolves aren't a cultural minority that you can point and say how they behave or what they want or defend, B) the setting pretty much had no idea on how wolves behave in nature, so Red Talon culture isn't wolf culture, it is Red Talon culture, and C) Luddism is a pretty human idea.<br /> <br /> The Red Talons are just a sick inference that a whole culture can be geared towards hate and endorsement of terrorism, and actually solely defined by it, and that for the wronged genocide is an ok idea. They're not a persecuted group, they're a joke on persecuted groups.<br /> <br /> <br /> That's the same problem they had with Gehenna. Instead of going for it all out or postponing it, they decided it came and was kind of not a big deal in the big picture. So move to the next step in the metaplot, but don't change the <i>status quo</i> too much. That's my whole expectation for W5.<br /> <br /> Both going all out or backing down and postponing the Apocalypse would be better decisions, with a healthy update of the setting, but not forgetting that it is Werewolf, not Angstwolf.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would like it if the Red Talons act like more actually wolves with the decades of research of the true nature of wolves as shy ,intelligent, equlltiran, friends with ravens/Corax creatures.. that would make them more like less.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","user":"Konradleijon","date":". 09-23-2021, 07:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T16:59:19-07:00","id":1461108,"title":"","content":"So the main take away here and elsewhere is a bunch of folks who never liked WtA or don't know much about it think this sounds ' vaguely interesting' and those of us that love and play the game are deeply worried.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/479-damian-may","name":"Damian May","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar479_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1199"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-23T17:03:59-07:00","id":1461109,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Damian May</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1460916-werewolf-5th-edition-information-in-crimson-thaw?p=1461108#post1461108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So the main take away here and elsewhere is a bunch of folks who never liked WtA or don't know much about it think this sounds ' vaguely interesting' and those of us that love and play the game are deeply worried.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that's a overly large statement to make. Especially since my die-hard Werefan partners are very excited.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i